# Marketplays — Seller Portal

**Source of truth:** `docs/marketplays_cursor_rules.md` **Section 7** (+ always **Sections 1–2**). Design tokens: **Section 3**. Booking transitions: **Section 5.2**.

## Hard rules
- Entry is **Revenue Dashboard** (`/dashboard/seller`), not My Listings
- KPI order: Revenue (30d) → Active bookings → Avg CIS → Occupancy
- Desktop grid 60/40: left = booking feed; right = chart + CIS + actions + payout
- Status pills map 1:1 to Section 1.3 enum — no invented labels
- Publish guard: Stripe Connect + required fields + ≥1 image
- Seller may only Accept/Decline (request bookings) and Upload Proof; all other status changes are system-only
